1117	//  P2 — CLS + POS owner-scan. dh0 [T,d] (bf16) holds grad wrt h0 (post-cat,
1118	//    pre-pos). cls_token grad = Σ_samp dh0[CLS row (pos 0)]; pos.weight[p] grad
1119	//    = Σ_t dh0[t] over t with (t%kSeq)==p (ALL 17 positions). Fixed t-order +
1120	//    single owner per element → deterministic, atomic-free. The owner of a
1121	//    feature j is round-robin (j % ... is implicit via thread stride; only ONE
1122	//    CTA — cta 0 — writes these tiny ([d] and [17×d]) tensors to avoid a
